{"event": "turn", "session_id": "48cf3d6cb4894f208ad2505667ae3053", "sequence": 1, "created_at": "2026-10-16T06:24:54.033287+00:00", "message": "请介绍KSA的待客饮茶习俗。", "resolved_question": "请介绍KSA的待客饮茶习俗。", "context_turns": 0, "model": "deepseek-flash", "thinking": "disabled", "config_revision": 3, "compliance_blocked": false, "elapsed_seconds": 17.205, "model_calls": 3, "input_tokens": 5800, "output_tokens": 793, "response": {"answer": "关于KSA（沙特阿拉伯）的待客饮茶习俗，根据本次检索到的资料，可以介绍以下内容：\n\n**待客顺序与场合**\n据 Saudipedia 记载，沙特待客礼仪中通常先上咖啡、后上茶；如果场合包含午餐或晚餐，茶有时会在餐后较晚时段才端上。这些是文献记录的习俗，并非每个家庭都必须遵循的统一规则。（来源：Drinks in Saudi Arabia, Saudipedia，年份未标注）\n\n**风味添加**\n茶中可能加入薄荷、婆婆纳（speedwell）或其他芳香叶片。（来源同上）\n\n**一种特色做法：炭火茶（ember tea）**\nSaudipedia 描述的做法是：先在壶中用炭火煮沸水和糖，再加入粗茶叶。这种风格与户外露营场景相关。（来源同上）\n\n**需要说明的边界**\n- 上述内容仅为文献记录的习俗，不代表所有家庭或地区的普遍做法。\n- 关于KSA茶叶的具体风味、用途等商品属性，本次未检索到可验证的证据，无法提供。\n- 本次检索到的其他资料（UNESCO 关于土耳其/阿塞拜疆 çay 文化、Go Türkiye 关于土耳其红茶）均不属于KSA，故不在此作为KSA习俗引用。\n- 本次检索到的 FAO 2014 年沙特红茶消费量数据属于历史预测，不是当前实时消费数据，故不在此作为现状引用。\n\n如需了解具体茶叶商品的价格或库存，请提供商品信息，我可另行查询实时数据。", "intent": "question_answering", "intents": ["question_answering"], "confidence": null, "intent_source": "rules", "recommendations": [], "knowledge_sources": [{"title": "Drinks in Saudi Arabia, Saudipedia", "url": "https://saudipedia.com/en/drinks-in-saudi-arabia", "year": null}, {"title": "Culture of Çay (tea), UNESCO Intangible Cultural Heritage", "url": "https://ich.unesco.org/en/RL/culture-of-cay-tea-a-symbol-of-identity-hospitality-and-social-interaction-01685?RL=01685", "year": null}, {"title": "Tea as a Symbol of Common Life and Culture in Anatolia, Go Türkiye", "url": "https://goturkiye.com/gastronomy/blog/tea-as-a-symbol-of-common-life-and-culture-in-anatolia", "year": null}, {"title": "Medium-term outlook for tea, 2014 FAO projection", "url": "https://www.fao.org/fileadmin/templates/est/meetings/IGGtea21/14-Inf3-CurrentSituation.pdf", "year": 2023}], "memory_used": false, "clarification_required": false, "tasks": [{"id": "s1", "tool": 